---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Privacy policy - Naturide" pageType="privacy">
  <section class="site-section py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-forest-900 sm:text-4xl dark:text-sand-50">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-forest-800/70 dark:text-sand-200/70">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US')}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-forest mt-8 max-w-none space-y-6 text-forest-800/90 dark:text-sand-200/90">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">1. Data controller</h2>
          <p>
            The data controller is the owner of the Naturide project, contact:
            <a href="mailto:mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com" class="text-forest-700 underline dark:text-sand-100">mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">2. What data we collect</h2>
          <p>Through Naturide.app we may collect:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Email address - if you apply to take part in the internal app testing.</li>
            <li>Technical data (IP address, browser type, operating system) - for statistics and security.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">3. Purpose of processing</h2>
          <p>We process data only to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>Contact you about taking part in Naturide's internal testing and share testing-related information.</li>
            <li>Reply to questions sent by email.</li>
            <li>Analyze site traffic (anonymized data).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">4. Legal basis</h2>
          <p>The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR (consent) for an internal testing application, and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest) for technical data needed to operate the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">5. Retention</h2>
          <p>We keep your email until internal testing ends or until you withdraw consent (removals are processed within 7 business days). Technical data is kept only as long as needed for security purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">6. Your rights</h2>
          <p>You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
            <li>access your data,</li>
            <li>rectify your data,</li>
            <li>erase your data (right to be forgotten),</li>
            <li>restrict processing,</li>
            <li>data portability,</li>
            <li>object to processing,</li>
            <li>lodge a complaint with your data protection authority.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>To exercise your rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com" class="text-forest-700 underline dark:text-sand-100">mkwiatek.dev@gmail.com</a> or use the <a href="/en/remove-data/" class="text-forest-700 underline dark:text-sand-100">data removal form</a>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">7. Cookies</h2>
          <p>The site may use cookies for analytics (e.g. anonymized visit statistics). You can disable cookies in your browser settings.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">8. Changes</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to update this policy. Material changes will be announced on the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-forest-900 dark:text-sand-50">9. Data processor</h2>
          <p>
            The internal testing application form is handled by Cloudflare Pages Functions, and form data is
            stored in Cloudflare D1. Notifications about new applications are sent through Web3Forms.
            Information about data processing by these services is available at
            <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-700 underline dark:text-sand-100">cloudflare.com</a>
            and <a href="https://web3forms.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-forest-700 underline dark:text-sand-100">web3forms.com</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
